+        "LayoutEditor__TitleBlock__StatusDefaultNote": "What a sheet prints until a status is chosen for it. Empty on purpose: the cell is drawn with its label and no value. Every drawing made before the field existed would otherwise start claiming a status nobody gave it, and a wrong status on an issued drawing is worse than none. Set it to an entry from Statuses to give new and untouched sheets that one instead.",
+        "LayoutEditor__TitleBlock__StatusDefault": "",
