+        "LayoutEditor__Leader__NoteTooltipNote": "With Select or Move up, resting the pointer on a specification bubble's circle for NoteTooltipMs names its note beside the pointer - the code in bold, then the note's title (EW01  Loggia Arcade) - so a code can be read zoomed in, with the notes margin off the screen. A bubble linked to a note, or unlinked but reading a note's code, names it; one on a locked layer too, one on a reference layer not. Moving straight on to the next bubble names that one at once. NoteTooltip false turns it off; 0 ms shows it at once."
